<title>UK: EBRD adds 1.0 bln rand to 30-year zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>EBRD adds 1.0 bln rand to 30-year zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 6.0 billion rand from 5.0 billion rand, lead manager Toronto Dominion said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT   *6.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    07.ARP.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  2.85	PAY DATE    07.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    2.70	SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 5.0 BLN RAND LAUNCHED 10.MAR AT 2.35</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   15 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
